<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="FLUX Context transforms and creates photos instantly with AI magic. Why struggle with complex editing? Create stunning visuals effortlessly!">
    <title>FLUX Context: Try Free - Transform Any Image in Seconds</title>
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://fluxcontext.pro" />
   <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #0066CC;
            --secondary-color: #5856D6;
            --accent-color: #FF6B35;
            --background-color: #ffffff;
            --section-bg: #f8fafc;
            --text-color: #1a202c;
            --text-light: #718096;
            --border-color: #e2e8f0;
            --shadow-light: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            --shadow-medium: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            --shadow-large: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            --spacing-unit: 2rem;
            --border-radius: 12px;
            --transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--background-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 var(--spacing-unit);
        }

        /* Header Styles */
        header {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .header-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1.2rem var(--spacing-unit);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        nav a {
            margin-left: 2.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-weight: 500;
            position: relative;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        nav a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            bottom: -4px;
            left: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        nav a:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            padding: 10rem 0 6rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.9) 0%, rgba(118, 75, 162, 0.9) 100%);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero .container {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        /* Button Styles */
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 1.2rem 2.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-color), #ff8a65);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);
            transition: var(--transition);
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-large);
        }

        /* Section Styles */
        section {
            padding: 5rem 0;
        }

        section:nth-child(even) {
            background-color: var(--section-bg);
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        h4 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        p {
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* Grid Layouts */
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 2.5rem;
            margin: 4rem 0;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-light);
            transition: var(--transition);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .feature-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-large);
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            color: var(--text-light);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .feature-card ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding-left: 0;
        }

        .feature-card ul li {
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
        }

        .feature-card ul li::before {
            content: '✓';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Lists */
        ol, ul {
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            padding-left: 2rem;
        }

        ol li, ul li {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        /* FAQ Styles */
        .faq-item {
            background: white;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-light);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-color);
        }

        .faq-question {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .faq-item p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        /* CTA Section */
        .cta-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color) 0%, var(--secondary-color) 100%);
            padding: 6rem 0;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .cta-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .cta-section h2 {
            color: white !important;
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
            line-height: 1.2;
            background: none !important;
            -webkit-background-clip: initial !important;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: white !important;
            background-clip: initial !important;
        }

        .cta-section p {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
            line-height: 1.6;
            text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--text-color) 0%, #2d3748 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 0;
            margin-top: 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        footer::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
        }

        .footer-main {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            padding: 4rem 0;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .footer-brand-section {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .footer-logo h3 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #e2e8f0);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .footer-logo p {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .footer-stats {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .footer-stat {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-stat .stat-number {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .footer-stat .stat-text {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .footer-links-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .footer-column h4 {
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .footer-column ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .footer-column ul li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .footer-column ul li a {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: var(--transition);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .footer-column ul li a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        .footer-cta {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 3rem 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-cta-content h4 {
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .footer-cta-content p {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .footer-cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-color), #ff8a65);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .footer-cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-large);
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            padding: 2rem 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .footer-bottom-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .footer-bottom-content p {
            margin: 0;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .footer-bottom-links span {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .container {
                padding: 0 1.5rem;
            }

            .footer-main {
                gap: 3rem;
            }

            .footer-links-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                gap: 1.5rem;
            }

            .footer-stats {
                gap: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 2.8rem;
            }

            h2 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .header-content {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
                padding: 1rem;
            }

            nav {
                margin-top: 1rem;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 0 1rem;
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 8rem 0 4rem;
            }

            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 1.5rem;
            }

            .feature-card {
                padding: 2rem;
            }

            section {
                padding: 3rem 0;
            }

            .cta-section {
                padding: 4rem 0;
            }

            .cta-section h2 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }

            .cta-section p {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }

            .footer-main {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 3rem;
                padding: 3rem 0;
            }

            .footer-brand-section {
                text-align: center;
            }

            .footer-links-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .footer-stats {
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 3rem;
            }

            .footer-cta {
                padding: 2rem 0;
            }

            .footer-bottom-content {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 0 1rem;
            }

            .cta-button {
                padding: 1rem 2rem;
                font-size: 1rem;
            }

            .feature-card {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        /* Animation for page load */
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .hero .container > * {
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        .feature-card {
            animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out;
            animation-fill-mode: both;
        }

        .feature-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
        .feature-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .feature-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
        .feature-card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        .feature-card:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
        .feature-card:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }

        /* Examples Section */
        .examples-section {
            padding: 4rem 0;
            background-color: var(--section-bg);
        }

        .examples-container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .examples-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .example-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .image-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 350px;
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            background: white;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-light);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .image-label {
            position: absolute;
            top: 1rem;
            left: 1rem;
            z-index: 10;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .image-label.original {
            background: var(--text-color);
            color: white;
        }

        .image-label.enhanced {
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
        }

        .example-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
            padding: 1rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .image-container:hover .example-image {
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .prompt-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .prompt-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .prompt-card h4 {
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .prompt-card p {
            color: var(--text-light);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .examples-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 1.5rem;
            }

            .image-container {
                max-width: 280px;
            }

            .examples-section {
                padding: 3rem 0;
            }

            .prompt-card {
                padding: 1.25rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="header-content container">
            <div class="logo">Flux Context</div>
            <nav>
                <a href="#features">Features</a>
                <a href="#how-to">How to Use</a>
                <a href="#why">Why Choose</a>
                <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Transform Your Ideas with Flux Context AI</h1>
            <p>Looking for "Flux Context"? You've found exactly what you were searching for! Meet FLUX.1 Kontext - the revolutionary AI image generation and editing tool that transforms your creative workflow.</p>
            <a href="https://flux-1.net/flux-context" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-button">Try Flux Context Free</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="examples-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Flux Context Examples</h2>
            
            <div class="examples-container">
                <div class="examples-grid">
                    <!-- Before Image -->
                    <div class="example-item">
                        <div class="image-container">
                            <div class="image-label original">Original</div>
                            <img 
                                src="https://cdn.flux-1.net/flux1/examples/flux-kontext-step-1-1748660152059.png"
                                alt="FLUX context AI Image"
                                class="example-image"
                            />
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- After Image -->
                    <div class="example-item">
                        <div class="image-container">
                            <div class="image-label enhanced">Enhanced</div>
                            <img 
                                src="https://cdn.flux-1.net/flux1/examples/flux-kontext-step-4-1749096342326.png"
                                alt="FLUX Context AI Image Editing Result"
                                class="example-image"
                            />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                        
                <div class="prompt-container">
                    <div class="prompt-card">
                        <h4>Flux Image Edit Prompt:</h4>
                        <p>Keep portrait, change the background to this: Serene beach sunset, vibrant orange and pink sky, golden sunlight reflecting on calm ocean waves, silhouettes of palm trees, soft gradient horizon, dreamy atmosphere, 4K detailed photography.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Powerful Features of Flux Context</h2>
            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Advanced Text-to-Image</h3>
                    <p>Create stunning images from text descriptions with state-of-the-art AI technology. Our advanced algorithms understand context and nuance, delivering precise results that match your vision.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Smart Image Editing</h3>
                    <p>Edit and transform images with natural language commands. From simple color adjustments to complex style transfers, Flux Context understands your intent and delivers professional results.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Style Transfer</h3>
                    <p>Apply and modify artistic styles while maintaining image integrity. Transform your photos into artwork inspired by any style or artist, with precise control over the result.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Batch Processing</h3>
                    <p>Process multiple images simultaneously with consistent style and quality. Perfect for creating cohesive visual content for your brand or project.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Real-time Preview</h3>
                    <p>See changes instantly as you adjust parameters and settings. Our lightning-fast processing ensures you spend less time waiting and more time creating.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Advanced Controls</h3>
                    <p>Fine-tune your results with professional-grade controls. Adjust everything from composition to color balance with intuitive sliders and precise numerical inputs.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="what-is">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>What is Flux Context?</h2>
            <p>Flux Context is a revolutionary AI-powered platform that combines advanced image generation and editing capabilities. Using cutting-edge technology, it allows you to create, modify, and enhance images through simple text commands. Whether you're a designer, artist, or content creator, Flux Context provides the tools you need to bring your vision to life.</p>
            
            <h3>The Power of Context-Aware AI</h3>
            <p>Unlike traditional AI image tools, Flux Context understands the relationship between elements in your images. This contextual awareness enables more intelligent editing, ensuring that changes to one part of an image naturally affect related elements, maintaining overall coherence and realism.</p>
            
            <h3>Professional-Grade Results</h3>
            <p>Built with professionals in mind, Flux Context delivers high-quality outputs suitable for commercial use. From marketing materials to artistic projects, our platform ensures your results meet the highest standards of quality and precision.</p>
            
            <h3>Seamless Workflow Integration</h3>
            <p>Flux Context is designed to fit seamlessly into your existing creative workflow. With support for industry-standard file formats and integration with popular design tools, you can enhance your productivity without disrupting your process.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="use-cases">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Flux Context Use Cases</h2>
            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Digital Marketing</h3>
                    <p>Create engaging social media content, advertising materials, and marketing assets quickly and consistently. Perfect for maintaining brand identity across multiple campaigns.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>E-commerce</h3>
                    <p>Generate and edit product photos efficiently. Maintain consistent style across your product catalog while reducing photography costs.</p>
                </div>
